; Tilted 30° on X so the item's profile faces the camera instead of just
; its top face — readable silhouette at a glance. The script spins the
; node on Y at runtime; that spin compounds with the X tilt so different
; facets rotate into view over the bob cycle.
[node name="Object" type="Node3D" parent="Visual"]
